  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Migration Overview</span>
        <h2>Understanding the Great Migration</h2>
        <p>Tanzania's Great Migration is one of nature's most spectacular events. While often associated with the Serengeti-Mara ecosystem, Zanzibar offers unique wildlife experiences year-round.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="migration-overview">
        <p>The Great Migration involves over 1.5 million wildebeest, zebra, and Thomson's gazelle moving in a circular pattern through the Serengeti-Mara ecosystem. The movement is driven by rainfall and grass growth, creating a dynamic calendar of wildlife viewing opportunities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Monthly Migration Calendar</span>
        <h2>When to See the Migration</span>
      </div>
      <div class="calendar-grid">
        <div class="calendar-month reveal">
          <h3>January - March</h3>
          <p>Southern Serengeti — Calving Season</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Approximately 500,000 wildebeest calves are born</li>
            <li>Predator activity is high (lions, cheetahs, hyenas)</li>
            <li>Excellent predator viewing</li>
            <li>Good time for Zanzibar beach extension</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="calendar-month reveal delay-2">
          <h3>April - May</h3>
          <p>Western Serengeti — Long Rains Period</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Animals move west and north</li>
            <li>Some lodges close due to rains</li>
            <li>Lower tourist numbers — better deals</li>
            <li>Good bird watching</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="calendar-month reveal delay-3">
          <h3>June - July</h3>
          <p>Northern Serengeti & Maasai Mara River Crossings</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Iconic river crossings at Grumeti and Mara River</li>
            <li>Highest concentration of wildlife</li>
            <li>Peak tourist season</li>
            <li>Best for photography</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="calendar-month reveal delay-4">
          <h3>August - October</h3>
          <p>Masai Mara, Kenya</p>
          <ul>
            <li> wildebeest cross into Kenya's Masai Mara</li>
            <li>Dry season — excellent game viewing</li>
            <li>Good time for Zanzibar beach holiday</li>
            <li>Peak season — book early</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="calendar-month reveal delay-5">
          <h3>November - December</h3>
          <p>Return South</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Herds begin moving back to Serengeti</li>
            <li>Short rains begin</li>
            <li>Fewer tourists</li>
            <li>Good value for safari and beach</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Zanzibar Wildlife Highlights</span>
        <h2>Zanzibar's Own Wildlife Calendar</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="zanzibar-wildlife">
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal">
          <h3>Turtle Nesting</h3>
          <p>January - March: Green and hawksbill turtles nest on Zanzibar's beaches, particularly Nungwi and Jambiani.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Night turtle watching tours available</li>
            <li>Support conservation efforts</li>
            <li>See hatchlings make their way to the sea</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal delay-2">
          <h3>Dolphin Season</h3>
          <p>Year-round: Bottlenose and humpback dolphins are commonly sighted.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Best viewing: Early morning trips</li>
            <li>Kizimkazi (south coast) is the prime location</li>
            <li>Ethical dolphin watching guidelines apply</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal delay-3">
          <h3>Humpback Whales</h3>
          <p>July - October: Humpback whales migrate through Zanzibar channels.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Whale watching tours available</li>
            <li>Possible to see breaching and calf behavior</li>
            <li>Combine with safari and beach</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="wildlife-item reveal delay-4">
          <h3>Bird Migration</h3>
          <p>November - April: Migratory birds pass through Zanzibar.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Excellent for bird watching</li>
            <li>Many species from Europe and Asia</li>
            <li>Nungwi and Jambiani are prime spots</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
