        <div class="recommendation reveal">
          <h3>Safari First, Then Zanzibar</h3>
          <p>Many travelers do a mainland safari followed by a Zanzibar beach relaxation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>June - October: Best overall — dry season, great migration</li>
            <li>January - February: Great for calving season, less crowded</li>
            <li>Book safari lodges well in advance for peak season</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="recommendation reveal delay-2">
          <h3>Zanzibar First, Then Safari</h3>
          <p>Relax on the beach then explore Tanzania's wildlife.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>July - October: Whale watching combined with safari</li>
            <li>November - December: Lower rates, good value</li>
            <li>Perfect for honeymooners wanting beach then adventure</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="recommendation reveal delay-3">
          <h3>Monthly Summary</h3>
          <p>January - March: Calving season, good birding, turtle nesting</p>
          <p>April - May: Low season, good deals, some lodges closed</p>
          <p>June - July: River crossings, peak season</p>
          <p>August - October: Masai Mara crossing, best wildlife viewing</p>
          <p>November - December: Return south, good value, birding</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

